### 2FA API Tests

### First, register a user for testing
POST https://localhost:3000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "testuser2fa",
    "password": "Test123@"
}

###

### Login to get JWT token for 2FA setup
POST https://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "testuser2fa",
    "password": "Test123@"
}

###

### Setup 2FA (requires JWT token)
POST https://localhost:3000/auth/2fa/setup
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6MSwidXNlcm5hbWUiOiJ0ZXN0dXNlcjJmYSIsImlhdCI6MTc1NTU0NTE0NSwiZXhwIjoxNzU1NTQ4NzQ1fQ.QZqoecg9Lz0VoRNZKiag6CB7BjnONKBS-uxP8QRS37s

{}

###

### Verify 2FA Setup (requires JWT token + 6-digit token from authenticator app)
POST https://localhost:3000/auth/2fa/verify-setup
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

{
    "token": "123456"
}

###

### Login with 2FA enabled (first step - username/password)
POST https://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "testuser2fa",
    "password": "Test123@"
}

###

### Verify 2FA Login (second step - 6-digit token from authenticator app)
POST https://localhost:3000/auth/2fa/verify-login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "userId": "1",
    "token": "123456"
}

###

### Disable 2FA (requires JWT token)
POST https://localhost:3000/auth/2fa/disable
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

{}

###

### Test Verify Setup with invalid token format (should fail)
POST https://localhost:3000/auth/2fa/verify-setup
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

{
    "token": "12345"
}

###

### Test Verify Setup with missing token (should fail)
POST https://localhost:3000/auth/2fa/verify-setup
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

{}

###

### Test Verify Login with invalid token format (should fail)
POST https://localhost:3000/auth/2fa/verify-login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "token": "12345"
}

###

### Test Verify Login with missing token (should fail)
POST https://localhost:3000/auth/2fa/verify-login
Content-Type: application/json

{}

